{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGalan War Song\u201d is a cultivation strategy game based on war chess and incorporating RPG elements. Players will take on the role of Bordeaux Dia, the 'Legendary King', and gather former mercenary companions to go to the Castle of Galan, defeat the Guilty Dragon, and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.poster.avif?t=1770277965\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.webm?t=1770277965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.mp4?t=1770277965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strong strategy turn-based RPG</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse mercenary designs: There are a total of 15 mercenaries available for collection, each with their own unique skills and combat style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich career options: 5 basic professions: Warrior, Swordsman, Mage, Archer, Auxiliary, each profession also has 2 job transfer options;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful equipment system: In addition to the numerical values, 100+ pieces of equipment also come with various talents and skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featured relics and props: By configuring soul stones and props for mercenaries before battle, assist the mercenary group in turning the tide of the battle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Rich monster levels: 40+ different levels, monster bosses have their own new mechanisms, and the estimated campaign time is 20-30 hours;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong tactics, high strategy: All mercenaries are extremely powerful when used properly. All you have to do is to reasonably play their strengths on the premise of understanding the characteristics of the monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.poster.avif?t=1770277965\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.webm?t=1770277965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.mp4?t=1770277965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Conquer the Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/76da9a53f4d6463a674db44f5a57c44a8c6df9ce.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer the Isle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/76da9a53f4d6463a674db44f5a57c44a8c6df9ce.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer the Swamp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/76da9a53f4d6463a674db44f5a57c44a8c6df9ce.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer the Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/76da9a53f4d6463a674db44f5a57c44a8c6df9ce.jpg"},{"name":"Forge Artifacts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/f5bd0355c4edaa6a02b871d57322e75a5feae176.jpg"},{"name":"Promotion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/7ad381246d7b618ae8e75deb0d010df44ec549fc.jpg"},{"name":"Final Form","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3545810/dbb4735df210721341b34